.text:0000000140002724                 db 'e send 50,000 USDT to this address within 5 days, and we will ens'
.text:0000000140002765                 db 'ure that your data is not damaged and will be restored. Wishing y'
.text:00000001400027A6                 db 'ou a pleasant day.',0
